  "content": "<h1>探索</h1>\n<h4>为游戏增添更多原版风格的建筑结构</h4>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n\n<p><b>目前已加入的结构：</b></p>\n\n<table>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b>遗忘之井</b></td>\n            <td><b>丛林神庙</b></td>\n            <td><b>神社</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cLxYjbk/forgotten-well.png\" alt=\"遗忘之井\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" />\n            </td>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tY40Ttq/jungle-temple.png\" alt=\"丛林神庙\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" />\n            </td>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5xKMs5S/shrine.png\" alt=\"神社\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\"3\"><b>地下神庙</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\"3\">\n                <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0cKmPqp/underground-temple.png\" alt=\"地下神庙\" width=\"250\"\n                    height=\"250\" />\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n                <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3SLhq9h/underground-temple-2.png\" alt=\"地下神庙\" width=\"250\"\n                    height=\"250\" />\n                &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n                <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3CfqXrz/underground-temple-3.png\" alt=\"地下神庙\" width=\"250\"\n                    height=\"250\" />\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b>浮空岛</b></td>\n            <td><b>巨型橡树</b></td>\n            <td><b>原木堆</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LYMX3kg/floating-island.png\" alt=\"浮空岛\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n            </td>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9c8YJKD/large-oak-tree.png\" alt=\"巨型橡树\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n            </td>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/chKJKLd/logs.png\" alt=\"原木堆\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b>沙漠遗迹</b></td>\n            <td colspan=\"2\"><b>史莱姆洞穴</b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wKZ2wnL/desert-ruin.gif\" alt=\"沙漠遗迹\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></td>\n            <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DC7fFYN/slime-cave-raw.png\" alt=\"史莱姆洞穴\" width=\"500\" height=\"250\">\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n<p><span>官方数据包：</span></p>\n<ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/no-more-floating-islands\">NoMoreFloatingIslands</a>\n        => 防止浮空岛生成</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n\n若您对本模组有任何疑问，或想了解即将推出的功能：\n<br>\n欢迎加入 Discord 社群 &nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\" />\n</a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">连结</a>",
